The Rekor integrated time is exactly equal to the end of the transparency log
key's trust-root validity period. TimeRange is a closed interval, so
verification should succeed.

Creation: copy the bundle from `happy-path-v0.1`, export the production trusted
root, find the tlog matching the bundle's log ID
`wNI9atQGlz+VWfO6LRygH4QUfY/8W4RFwiT5i5WRgB0=`, and set
`publicKey.validFor.end` to the bundle's integrated time (`1689177396`) in RFC
3339 form: `2023-07-12T15:56:36Z`.
